// The shop — the module system demo: the directory tree is the module
// tree, references are qualified paths, and `internal/` is the
// compiler-enforced private subtree.
//
//   emo run main.emo
//
// Run it from this directory: the working directory is the project
// root, and every sibling `.emo` file is a module at its path.

// Sibling modules are referenced by their path — no import statement.
print(checkout.checkout(21))
print(pricing.price(3))
